{"title":"Bird Photographer of the Year for 2025","link":"https://kottke.org/25/10/bird-photographer-of-the-year-for-2025","date":1760016834000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"868\" alt=\"a huge school of small silvery fish swirl around a diving bird\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"866\" alt=\"a golden eagle feeding on the carcass of a deer\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"908\" alt=\"drone photo of a flock of geese flying over a stark brown and white abstract landscape\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/bpoty25-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"867\" alt=\"the blurred shape of a swan coming in to land against an abstract background of blurred swans\" /></p>\n\n<p>The organizers of the Bird Photographer of the Year competition received more than 33,000 images for 2025’s contest; <a href=\"https://www.birdpoty.com/2025-winners\">here are the winners and runners-up</a>. Photos above by Franco Banfi, Francesco Guffanti, Tibor Litauszki, and Andreas Hemb.</p>\n\n<p>If you have no idea what you’re seeing in that third photo by Tibor Litauszki, you’re not alone — even after reading the photographer’s description (<a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/photography/archive/2025/09/winners-bird-photographer-year-2025/684399/?gift=j9r7avb6p-KY8zdjhsiSZ-iXZoGmUIGt-0w23XbXxgI\">courtesy of In Focus</a>), I can’t figure it out:</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>It was January and nature had created some very interesting shapes in the saline lakes near Akasztó in Hungary. I sent up my drone and was looking for the right composition when a dozen geese suddenly flew into view. I immediately started taking photos and luckily everything fell into place — the composition as well as the geese.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>And eagles? Huge monsters. Dinosaurs never went extinct. (via <a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/photography/archive/2025/09/winners-bird-photographer-year-2025/684399/?gift=j9r7avb6p-KY8zdjhsiSZ-iXZoGmUIGt-0w23XbXxgI\">in focus</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of\">best of</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of%202025\">best of 2025</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/birds\">birds</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/10/bird-photographer-of-the-year-for-2025\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"238bca2ea773a7f86620e18bd50c44f2832a02bd3f4d182af8f41624a6567470","category":"Sites"}